  speakerName: "PH\xD3 L\xDD"
  title: "X\xE2y d\u1EF1ng & n\xE2ng c\u1EA5p"
  content: "Khi t\xE0i nguy\xEAn \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EE7, c\u1EADu c\xF3 th\u1EC3
    d\u1EF1ng th\xEAm nh\xE0, ho\u1EB7c n\xE2ng c\u1EA5p nh\u1EEFng g\xEC \u0111\xE3
    c\xF3. M\u1ED9t ng\xF4i l\xE0ng l\u1EDBn h\u01A1n \u0111\u1ED3ng ngh\u0129a v\u1EDBi
    nhi\u1EC1u b\xE0n tay h\u01A1n, nhi\u1EC1u hy v\u1ECDng h\u01A1n."
  portrait: {fileID: 1871985265, guid: 05340f7438bce374e96af080bb0729ad, type: 3}
